		)
		(uuid "1c60116b-b83e-5bad-8340-b8eea7898a4b")
	)
	(text "IN+ = own PWM; IN- = complementary switch, falling edge stretched 3.65k/100p\n(interlock + min dead time = max(firmware, hardware)). Bias PG (active low) pulls RDY low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 107.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4255ed1a-b1a4-5e6b-90c8-9b7769048301")
	)
	(text "LEG A: LAYOUT RULES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 289.356 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "663c5ea2-b43f-5161-b8aa-c7397cd1cf8d")
	)
	(text "AL: DESAT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 182.792 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "732de092-ac28-5e8d-904a-6c935f1bc43f")
	)
	(text "DESAT pin (internal 500 uA blanking source, trip 8.5-10.0 V) - Rs - 2 x BYG23T-M3/TR (1300 V each) - drain.\nBAT54S keeps DX between COM and VDD against dv/dt through the string; Cblk footprint DNP."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 251.772 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a05f06ce-1690-5542-af65-6ee7709c1602")
	)
	(text "SN6505B push-pull 420 kHz from +5V, BIAS_EN high = on; T_BIAS4 custom, functional insulation\n(PD-free >= 1.75 kVpk, <= 5 pF per secondary). Per channel: bridge, PNP regulator VDD-VEE, ATL431 COM split."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.222 276.856 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a0629eea-7b08-5eb7-98ef-b41aecadf346")
	)
	(text "DESAT > 10.3-10.9 V (above the 10.0 V maximum trip of the -Q1 grade) -> MMBT3904 -> MMBT3906 charges BG to VEE + 10 V;\nper device AO3400A + 22R pull the gate to VEE; BG holds ~3 us (1k + FET gates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 660.3058 82.392 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a3cb35b4-1ffd-5f5a-9871-3be0a77fe248")
	)
	(text "2 x ZXTP25040DFH emitter followers on OUTL (B-E 1k, C to VEE): each sinks the Roff current of 3 gates;\nthe NSI6651 supplies base current only. Turn-on stays on OUTH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 443.463 71.252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b71bf537-00c3-5a84-9e22-3e10cd102195")
	)
	(text "Per device: Ron/Roff, 0.5R Kelvin R to the COM star, 10k and Zeners (about +21 V / -5.7 V) on its own Kelvin net.\nMiller hold: N-MOSFET clamp (PMV30ENEA) gate-pin to a local VEE (1u on the Kelvin pin). LAYOUT: FET + 1u at the device, loop <= 1 nH."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 134.536 170.292 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bf71647c-52ad-51b7-8461-f23e756b5d58")
	)
